## PublicApi

### List enabled currency codes accepted for billing and preferences
## List enabled currency codes accepted for billing and preferences
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/currencies
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### List supported UI locales with English and native display names
## List supported UI locales with English and native display names
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/locales
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Fetch a base64 JPEG captcha challenge for human verification
## Fetch a base64 JPEG captcha challenge for human verification
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/captcha
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### List enabled countries keyed by ISO-2/ISO-3/numeric code
## List enabled countries keyed by ISO-2/ISO-3/numeric code
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/countries?fetchBy={{fetchBy}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

